data fleet_host_memory_nominal_vs_usable_note: String = "Two DISTINCT memory facts for fleet hosts, must not be conflated: (1) NOMINAL DIMM population — srv1/srv2/srv3 host memory derives from per-DIMM BMC Redfish observations through HostMemoryPopulation rows (module × stick_count), all three hosts observed 2026-07-16 (deferral scaffolds retired on the srv1/srv2 observation); (2) OS-USABLE budget — gunbc_ci_host.memory byte_size(134217728000) = exactly 125 GiB, MemTotal-shaped CI runner budget authority (roadmap 128c/125GiB; floor peak receipts from srv1/srv2). The usable figure requires its OWN OS MemTotal provenance — never a blind rewrite from 125 GiB usable to 128 GiB nominal."

data srv1_memory_population_observation_note: String = "srv1 BMC 192.168.1.183 Redfish observation 2026-07-16 (rotated cred, operator-supplied): MemorySummary TotalSystemMemoryGiB=128; per-DIMM dimm0..dimm7 all HMA82GR7AFR4N-VK RankCount=1 DataWidthBits=64 BusWidthBits=72 CapacityMiB=16384 OperatingSpeedMhz=2666 (×8). Uniform 8-stick population of the existing cited row hma82gr7afr4n_vk_catalog (AFR4N=x4 1R) totals 128 GiB — dissolves the gibibyte(128) placeholder."

data srv1_memory_population: HostMemoryPopulation = HostMemoryPopulation {
  rows: [
    MemoryPopulationRow { module: hma82gr7afr4n_vk_catalog, stick_count: 8 },
  ],
}

data srv2_memory_population_observation_note: String = "srv2 BMC 192.168.1.184 Redfish observation 2026-07-16 (rotated cred, operator-supplied): MemorySummary TotalSystemMemoryGiB=128; per-DIMM dimm0..dimm7 all HMA82GR7AFR4N-VK RankCount=1 DataWidthBits=64 BusWidthBits=72 CapacityMiB=16384 OperatingSpeedMhz=2666 (×8). Uniform 8-stick population of the existing cited row hma82gr7afr4n_vk_catalog (AFR4N=x4 1R) totals 128 GiB — dissolves the gibibyte(128) placeholder."

data srv2_memory_population: HostMemoryPopulation = HostMemoryPopulation {
  rows: [
    MemoryPopulationRow { module: hma82gr7afr4n_vk_catalog, stick_count: 8 },
  ],
}

data srv3_memory_population_observation_note: String = "srv3 BMC 192.168.1.192 Redfish observation 2026-07-16 (factory cred): MemorySummary TotalSystemMemoryGiB=128; per-DIMM dimm0 HMA82GR7AFR8N-VK RankCount=2 DataWidthBits=64 BusWidthBits=72 CapacityMiB=16384 OperatingSpeedMhz=2666 (×7); dimm7 HMA82GR7AFR4N-VK RankCount=1 DataWidthBits=64 BusWidthBits=72 CapacityMiB=16384 OperatingSpeedMhz=2666 (×1). Part-number decode: AFR8N=x8 2R → hma82gr7afr8n_vk_catalog; AFR4N=x4 1R → existing hma82gr7afr4n_vk_catalog. Mixed 7+1 population totals 128 GiB — the fact the old gibibyte(128) literal was hiding."

data srv3_memory_population: HostMemoryPopulation = HostMemoryPopulation {
  rows: [
    MemoryPopulationRow { module: hma82gr7afr8n_vk_catalog, stick_count: 7 },
    MemoryPopulationRow { module: hma82gr7afr4n_vk_catalog, stick_count: 1 },
  ],
}

